    scoringRules: {
      summary: 'Basic scoring: Win 1 unit for each corresponding hand you beat, lose 1 unit for each hand that beats you. Special hands: Three of a kind in front wins 3 units instead of 1. Full house in middle wins 2 units. Four of a kind in back/middle wins 4 units. Royal/straight flush in back/middle wins 5 units. Special 13-card hands win automatically: Six pairs (3 units), Three straights (3 units), Three flushes (3 units), Complete straight A-K (13 units).',
